  "question": {
    "text": "An electron in an atom jumps in such a way that its kinetic energy changes from <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> to <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. The change in its potential energy (magnitude) will be-",
